[C1] PASS a linear field is exact on every face but the first, which copies its cell: face 0 = 2.5 (cell value; the linear value is 1.0); max error elsewhere 0.0e+00
[C2] PASS div of a uniform velocity is 0 and of v1 = 2.5 x1 is 2.5 in the interior: max |div| uniform 0.0e+00; max |div - 2.5| linear 0.0e+00
[C3] PASS theta_v = theta p / (rho R_d T): equal to theta for dry air, theta times R/R_d otherwise: dry 300, R = 1.02 R_d: 306
[C4] PASS path_<species> = sum rho_y V / A_bottom is the column mass per unit area on a Cartesian column: path 2.4 kg m^-2, sum rho_y dz 2.4
